{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HyR7ti7xZa1793314127.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>星巴克第四季度盈利多過預期，但收入不如預期，公司股價在延長交易時段變化不大。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利6.77億美元，按年增長逾4倍。經調整每股攤薄盈利80美仙，較預期多8美仙。淨收入逾91億美元，較預期少近1億美元。期內全球同店銷售增長百分之7.2，主要受平均單價增長推動，較預期的百分之6增幅高。交易量則增長百分之1.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:37:40.904715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T22:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:38:06.555017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:35:03.874062+00:00","content_hash":"1def1ebd9f82e81a264e965652927142ec0861ef592856f0c41521cfe189c608","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:37:40.904715+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}